@group A
@commands boot
@pass `Done (`; no mixin or event errors naming `SpoutGunFarmland`, `HandcraftedNightstand*`, `HandcraftedItemHoldingSaveMixin`, `TreatedStickPlaceMixin`, `TomatoClimbTreatedStickMixin`, `SuppTomatoClimbTreatedStickMixin`, `BlockItemOwnStackFillMixin`; `/setblock ~ ~ ~ creativedelight:treated_stick` works
